                        ],
                        "form": "прерыва́нии"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1043fd07-bd72-4763-a416-053d028d2299",
                        "entry_id": "55457647-f657-3053-9905-03eebd0a412e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "прерыва́ниях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2821c77-cee5-327a-bfb5-ad43aa25e3a7",
                        "entry_id": "55457647-f657-3053-9905-03eebd0a412e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. прерывать; действие или состояние по значению гл. прерываться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5140b178-d70b-4a74-9390-fc2d13db1e71",
                                "sense_id": "f2821c77-cee5-327a-bfb5-ad43aa25e3a7",
                                "text": "Дэви, исследуя явления при прерывании электрического тока, впервые наблюдал «вольтову дугу», которой мы теперь повсюду пользуемся для освещения .."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d036ed7e-cdf6-4ecb-9117-b699f74c9401",
                                "sense_id": "f2821c77-cee5-327a-bfb5-ad43aa25e3a7",
                                "text": "Но в некотором отношении можно говорить, что именно взаимное прерывание характерно для диалога вообще."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9288a7ed-efec-3504-b7a5-260a4c85dec7",
                        "entry_id": "55457647-f657-3053-9905-03eebd0a412e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комп. сигнал или событие, по которому компьютер прекращает выполнение текущей программы и начинает выполнять служебную программу"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07ca2083-bc3e-4af2-b69a-bd2e785e83ee",
                                "sense_id": "9288a7ed-efec-3504-b7a5-260a4c85dec7",
                                "text": "Каждому запросу прерывания в компьютере присваивается свой номер (тип прерывания), используемый для определения адреса обработчика…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "55e41ec7-f709-3415-bec0-a22dedbccec4",
                        "entry_id": "55457647-f657-3053-9905-03eebd0a412e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прогр. то же, что программа обслуживания прерывания; обработчик прерывания; программа, которую выполняет компьютер при возникновении прерывания [2]"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94928bb4-0c69-416e-819c-cbf3c5c88d64",
                                "sense_id": "55e41ec7-f709-3415-bec0-a22dedbccec4",
                                "text": "Прерывания BIOS представляют собой подпрограммы низкого уровня, облегчающие работу создателю операционной системы."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd4afefa-c2f0-47ea-bbfb-1e65e90d0a8b",
                        "source_entry_id": "55457647-f657-3053-9905-03eebd0a412e",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие; состояние",
                        "target_lang_word": "interruption",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interruption",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c8d0973-850f-35a9-9aba-0c950c7a5f55",
                                        "entry_id": "039eb0d1-5c02-3f3d-890e-b3357b55d7ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of interrupting, or the state of being interrupted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b572bdc-47fd-4048-b843-20ae0ca8421f",
                                                "sense_id": "2c8d0973-850f-35a9-9aba-0c950c7a5f55",
                                                "text": "One morning I had been driven to the precarious refuge afforded by the steps of the inn, after rejecting offers from the Celebrity to join him in a variety of amusements. But even here I was not free from interruption, for he was seated on a horse-block below me, playing with a fox terrier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "100263b3-3732-4ebc-b265-c0f729e1517a",
                                                "sense_id": "2c8d0973-850f-35a9-9aba-0c950c7a5f55",
                                                "text": "The dirty secret of the internet is that all this distraction and interruption is immensely profitable. Web companies like to boast about \"creating compelling content\", or offering services that let you \"stay up to date with what your friends are doing\"[…]and so on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a432b529-7d09-3c77-85ce-c5a568c42462",
                                        "entry_id": "039eb0d1-5c02-3f3d-890e-b3357b55d7ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the act of breaking into someone else’s speech."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2abe068d-54b3-370d-b16e-1a4989518087",
                                        "entry_id": "039eb0d1-5c02-3f3d-890e-b3357b55d7ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A time interval during which there is a cessation of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94b517c2-9f62-4a4e-bb28-61b97d3fed0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "55457647-f657-3053-9905-03eebd0a412e",
                        "source_sense_description": "действие; состояние",
                        "target_lang_word": "interrupt",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interrupt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23b6d70e-10b0-3b8d-a379-12f2c9e3d8d2",
                                        "entry_id": "394d72fe-c840-373e-9a68-41d3fa8eb8c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To disturb or halt (an ongoing process or action, or the person performing it) by interfering suddenly, especially by speaking."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0700eb68-b050-4658-a02f-871b73a37ccf",
                                                "sense_id": "23b6d70e-10b0-3b8d-a379-12f2c9e3d8d2",
                                                "text": "A maverick politician repeatedly interrupted the debate by shouting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69dc349b-e150-4892-a7fb-6172df806a08",
                                                "sense_id": "23b6d70e-10b0-3b8d-a379-12f2c9e3d8d2",
                                                "text": "Do not interrupt me in my course."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20a3d3f1-d931-40c7-8f13-8020f3662665",
                                                "sense_id": "23b6d70e-10b0-3b8d-a379-12f2c9e3d8d2",
                                                "text": "One saint's day in mid-term a certain newly appointed suffragan-bishop came to the school chapel, and there preached on “The Inner Life.” He at once secured attention by his informal method, and when presently the coughing of Jarvis […] interrupted the sermon, he altogether captivated his audience with a remark about cough lozenges being cheap and easily procurable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d468404c-1edc-3b3a-a709-57448ae910c4",
                                        "entry_id": "394d72fe-c840-373e-9a68-41d3fa8eb8c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To divide; to separate; to break the monotony of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1873379-e9fe-4564-b6a4-643559790fb4",
                                                "sense_id": "d468404c-1edc-3b3a-a709-57448ae910c4",
                                                "text": "The evenness of the road was not interrupted by a single hill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b805da7c-ffdc-3e1d-8304-d611092dd7a0",
                                        "entry_id": "394d72fe-c840-373e-9a68-41d3fa8eb8c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To assert to (a computer) that an exceptional condition must be handled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44176ee0-f712-4054-9673-9a87fc4697c1",
                                                "sense_id": "b805da7c-ffdc-3e1d-8304-d611092dd7a0",
                                                "text": "The packet receiver circuit interrupted the microprocessor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "interrupt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7463fd4f-0d94-3542-8d61-806a13953868",
                                        "entry_id": "7ca7dc94-4bad-3d42-bc4a-e5850bb3df25",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event that causes a computer or other device to temporarily cease what it was doing and attend to a condition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e5cb88a-d95b-4c39-963e-61edeed3a5e8",
                                                "sense_id": "7463fd4f-0d94-3542-8d61-806a13953868",
                                                "text": "The interrupt caused the packet handler routine to run."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
